p07 : V4.4
p08 : US Blanks 9'5"M (2010 catalog vector extraction; target 91.5 L)
p97 : This is a versatile high performance longboard blank designed to accommodate both machine and hand shaping. The deck is moderately flat with a slight taper out toward the tail to ensure maximum strength. It has slightly more volume in the nose and tail to allow more rocker to be shaped in if desired.
